   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with three hour of debate on H.R. 2454.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2009-06-26",
   "actionTime": "12:44:55",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 2454 with 3 hours of general debate. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions except motion to recommit with or without instructions. Measure will be considered read. A specified amendment is in order. In lieu of the amendment recommended by the Committee on Energy and Commerce now printed in the bill, an amendment in the nature of a substitute consisting of the text of H.R. 2998, modified by an amendment printed in part A of this report shall be considered as adopted.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2009-06-26",
   "actionTime": "12:44:54",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 587. (consideration: CR H7471-7686)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
